  "id": "msm_examples:spell_scroll_rules",
  "kind": "msm:rules",
  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A rule book with one rule per scroll: using a scroll takes one from the hand and casts its spell. Mending heals and gives Regeneration; Blinking teleports to where you look (Where the player looks stops at the first block or mob, up to 12 blocks); Storms spawns a lightning bolt where you look; Frost runs an effect command as the reader that slows every mob within 6 blocks. A one-second cooldown keeps a held button from reading a whole stack. The rules take items and use places, so they compile to a script; they need the Fabric mod jar export.",
